#. i18n: ectx: (Download AppImage) <summary>
#: rkward/plugins/00saveload/DownloadAppImage.rkh:17
#, kde-format
msgid "Adds a dialog to install or update an AppImage of RKWard"
msgstr "Dodaje dijaloški okvir za instalaciju ili ažuriranje RKWardova AppImagea."

#. i18n: ectx: (Download AppImage) <settings> <setting> (refers to element labelled "Save to")
#: rkward/plugins/00saveload/DownloadAppImage.rkh:30
#, kde-format
msgid "Select a target file to save the AppImage to."
msgstr "Odaberite ciljnu datoteku u koju ćete spremiti AppImage."

#. i18n: ectx: (Download AppImage) <settings> <setting> (refers to element labelled "RKWard release branch")
#: rkward/plugins/00saveload/DownloadAppImage.rkh:36
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Define which branch of RKWard you want to download: The latest stable "
"release, the latest development build (used for testing and probably buggy/"
"unstable) or an AppImage from a custom source."
msgstr "Odredite koju granu RKWarda želite preuzeti: najnovije stabilno izdanje, najnoviju razvojnu inačicu (namijenjenu testiranju, vjerojatno s greškama ili nestabilnu) ili AppImage iz prilagođenog izvora."

#. i18n: ectx: (Download AppImage) <settings> <setting> (refers to element labelled "URL")
#: rkward/plugins/00saveload/DownloadAppImage.rkh:39
#, kde-format
msgid "URL to look for the AppImage files."
msgstr "URL na kojem treba potražiti datoteke AppImage."

#. i18n: ectx: (Download AppImage) <settings> <setting> (refers to element labelled "Pattern")
#: rkward/plugins/00saveload/DownloadAppImage.rkh:42
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Regular expression to find links to the AppImage in the HTML code of the URL."
msgstr "Regularni izraz za pronalaženje poveznica na AppImage u HTML kodu URL-a."

#. i18n: ectx: (Download AppImage) <settings> <setting> (refers to element labelled "Download method")
#: rkward/plugins/00saveload/DownloadAppImage.rkh:46
#, kde-format
msgid "The method to use by download.file()."
msgstr "Način koji će upotrijebiti funkcija download.file()."

#. i18n: ectx: (Download AppImage) <settings> <setting> (refers to element labelled "Allow cached files")
#: rkward/plugins/00saveload/DownloadAppImage.rkh:49
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Is a server-side cached value acceptable? Disabling this is useful for "
"‘⁠http://⁠’ and ‘⁠https://⁠’ URLs. It will attempt to get a copy directly from "
"the site rather than from an intermediate cache."
msgstr "Je li prihvatljiva vrijednost iz predmemorije poslužitelja? Isključivanje ove mogućnosti korisno je za URL-ove ‘⁠http://⁠’ i ‘⁠https://⁠’. Pokušat će se preuzeti kopija izravno s web-mjesta, a ne iz posredne predmemorije."

#. i18n: ectx: (Download AppImage) <settings> <setting> (refers to element labelled "Timeout")
#: rkward/plugins/00saveload/DownloadAppImage.rkh:52
#, kde-format
msgid "The number of seconds allowed to try downloading the AppImage."
msgstr "Broj sekundi dopuštenih za pokušaj preuzimanja AppImagea."

