#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Generic data import) <summary>
#: rkward/plugins/00saveload/import/import_generic_rio.rkh:11
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Import a variety of formats. This is a generic approach based on the \"rio\" "
"R package, which in turn depends on a variety of further packages. If there "
"is a dedicated plugin for the format you wish to import, using that will "
"usually be preferable, as it will provide more specific options, and with "
"less packages to install."
msgstr "Uvezite razne formate. Ovo je opći pristup utemeljen na paketu jezika R „rio”, koji pak ovisi o nizu drugih paketa. Ako postoji namjenski dodatak za format koji želite uvesti, obično je bolje upotrijebiti njega jer nudi konkretnije mogućnosti i zahtijeva instalaciju manjeg broja paketa."

#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Generic data import) <usage>
#: rkward/plugins/00saveload/import/import_generic_rio.rkh:16
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Select the data file to import. An R object containing the data will be "
"created. This will usually be a data.frame, or a list."
msgstr "Odaberite datoteku podataka za uvoz. Stvorit će se objekt jezika R koji sadrži podatke. To će obično biti data.frame ili popis."

#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Import SPSS file) <settings> <setting> (refers to element labelled "Edit Object")
#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Generic data import) <settings> <setting> (refers to element labelled "Edit Object")
#: rkward/plugins/00saveload/import/import_generic_rio.rkh:24
#: rkward/plugins/00saveload/import/import_spss.rkh:23
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Whether the object should be opened for editing after it was imported. "
"Currently, this is only possible, if the object is saved as a data.frame "
"(see next option)."
msgstr "Treba li objekt otvoriti za uređivanje nakon uvoza. Trenutačno je to moguće samo ako se objekt spremi kao data.frame (pogledajte sljedeću mogućnost)."

#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Generic data import) <settings> <setting> (refers to element labelled "Import a list of all datasets")
#: rkward/plugins/00saveload/import/import_generic_rio.rkh:25
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Some data files may contain more than one set of data (e.g. several sheets "
"inside one excel file). Check this option to import all datasets as a list."
msgstr "Neke datoteke podataka mogu sadržavati više skupova podataka (npr. nekoliko radnih listova u jednoj datoteci programa Excel). Označite ovu mogućnost da biste sve skupove podataka uvezli kao popis."

#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Generic data import) <settings> <setting> (refers to element labelled "Import specific sub-set")
#: rkward/plugins/00saveload/import/import_generic_rio.rkh:26
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"For datasets containing more than one set of data, specify which set to "
"import (this will usually be a name or a number)."
msgstr "Za skupove podataka koji sadrže više skupova navedite koji treba uvesti (obično naziv ili broj)."

#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Generic data import) <settings> <setting> (refers to element labelled "Preview")
#: rkward/plugins/00saveload/import/import_generic_rio.rkh:27
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Preview imported data. Only the first 50 rows and columns are shown, for "
"performance reasons (and only the first dataset in case of multiple sets in "
"the file)."
msgstr "Pretpregled uvezenih podataka. Radi učinkovitosti prikazuje se samo prvih 50 redaka i stupaca (a ako datoteka sadrži više skupova, samo prvi skup)."

