#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Export RMarkdown) <settings> <setting> (refers to element labelled "Target format")
#: rkward/plugins/00saveload/save/ExportRMarkdown.rkh:24
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Set the target format for exported files. If you choose either \"All formats "
"defined in document\" or \"First format defined in document\", the formats "
"defined via output_format will be used, see the documentation on rmarkdown::"
"render()."
msgstr "Postavite ciljni format izvezenih datoteka. Ako odaberete „Svi formati definirani u dokumentu” ili „Prvi format definiran u dokumentu”, upotrijebit će se formati definirani putem output_format; pogledajte dokumentaciju za rmarkdown::render()."

