#: rkward/plugins/00saveload/save/ExportRMarkdown.rkh:30
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Choose the target directory to export to, file names are automatically "
"generated according to the formats defined in the document."
msgstr "Odaberite ciljni direktorij za izvoz. Nazivi datoteka automatski se generiraju prema formatima definiranim u dokumentu."

#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Export RMarkdown) <settings> <setting> (refers to element labelled "Markdown version")
#: rkward/plugins/00saveload/save/ExportRMarkdown.rkh:34
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Set the markdown version to use. Older v1 documents are rendered into HTML "
"format only, using the markdown package. If in doubt, leave it to the newer "
"v2; those documents are rendered using pandoc, which allows you to choose "
"between various output formats. But be aware that some formats may require "
"special configuration or templates to produce proper results."
msgstr "Postavite inačicu Markdowna koju treba upotrijebiti. Stariji dokumenti v1 prikazuju se samo u HTML formatu, uz paket markdown. Ako niste sigurni, ostavite noviju inačicu v2; ti se dokumenti obrađuju pomoću pandoca, koji omogućuje odabir raznih izlaznih formata. Imajte na umu da neki formati mogu zahtijevati posebnu konfiguraciju ili predloške za ispravan rezultat."

